WEBVTT

00:02:00.450 --> 00:02:02.230
This rain is awful.

00:02:02.230 --> 00:02:04.790
My underwear's soaked.

00:02:06.930 --> 00:02:08.640
Indeed.

00:02:08.640 --> 00:02:12.010
I'm a grimoire, a book.

00:02:12.010 --> 00:02:13.810
I don't like getting wet!

00:02:14.840 --> 00:02:18.160
Who was it a while back,
swimming in the ocean?

00:02:18.160 --> 00:02:19.020
Dunno.

00:02:19.020 --> 00:02:21.240
You don't know?

00:02:21.240 --> 00:02:23.710
You took a bath in a hot spring, too.

00:02:23.710 --> 00:02:25.830
I know nothing of a hot spring.

00:02:25.830 --> 00:02:26.890
You don't know them?

00:02:26.890 --> 00:02:32.650
I almost ended up shark bait
because you left me behind!

00:02:32.650 --> 00:02:35.300
I won't let you claim you've forgotten!

00:02:35.300 --> 00:02:39.010
It's your fault for doing something
that made me leave you behind.

00:02:39.010 --> 00:02:40.870
What?

00:02:42.970 --> 00:02:45.450
Why are you turning all red?

00:02:46.300 --> 00:02:48.450
N-No reason.

00:02:49.550 --> 00:02:52.980
This isn't going to stop for a while...

00:02:54.190 --> 00:02:55.520
What?

00:02:58.190 --> 00:03:00.660
What's wrong, Kuro?

00:03:00.660 --> 00:03:02.760
It's gone.

00:03:02.760 --> 00:03:04.280
Was something there just now?

00:03:04.280 --> 00:03:06.520
No. Looks like I imagined it.

00:03:20.660 --> 00:03:25.380
You're as good as always at inviting trouble in.

00:03:25.380 --> 00:03:30.440
I couldn't just leave her there.

00:03:30.440 --> 00:03:32.360
What's your name?

00:03:33.290 --> 00:03:34.980
My name is Kuro.

00:03:34.980 --> 00:03:36.460
Kuro Daijuji.

00:03:36.460 --> 00:03:38.090
And this is Al.

00:03:41.810 --> 00:03:43.570
Jeez...

00:03:43.570 --> 00:03:46.500
I'll talk to Raika tomorrow.

00:03:47.740 --> 00:03:48.810
Kuro?

00:03:50.380 --> 00:03:52.680
You can talk?

00:03:52.680 --> 00:03:55.920
Yes, I'm Kuro Daijuji.

00:03:55.920 --> 00:03:57.050
What's your name?

00:03:57.940 --> 00:03:59.450
Ennea.

00:03:59.450 --> 00:04:00.600
Ennea?

00:04:00.600 --> 00:04:01.750
I see.

00:04:01.750 --> 00:04:03.510
Ennea.

00:04:03.510 --> 00:04:07.930
Al, warm her up in the bath,
and give her a change of clothes.

00:04:07.930 --> 00:04:09.260
Why me?

00:04:09.260 --> 00:04:12.420
I can't do it...

00:04:12.420 --> 00:04:14.270
At this rate, she'll catch a cold.

00:04:14.270 --> 00:04:17.500
What a pain.

00:04:19.870 --> 00:04:21.870
Strip.

00:04:21.870 --> 00:04:23.190
Hey, Al!

00:04:23.190 --> 00:04:24.510
Don't take her clothes off here!

00:04:24.510 --> 00:04:27.580
You've got a lot of requests, you know that?

00:04:27.580 --> 00:04:30.310
Girl, come this way.

00:04:34.690 --> 00:04:36.030
Wounds?

00:04:41.190 --> 00:04:42.630
<i>Tekeli-li!</i>

00:05:04.740 --> 00:05:06.600
E-Ennea...

00:05:06.600 --> 00:05:08.050
Kuro, you up?

00:05:08.050 --> 00:05:12.620
I'm awake, but I feel like I'm about
to fade back into blackness...

00:05:12.620 --> 00:05:14.590
Then one more time.

00:05:14.590 --> 00:05:16.130
Here I go!

00:05:17.530 --> 00:05:18.760
You up?

00:05:18.760 --> 00:05:20.500
I-I'm going to die...

00:05:20.500 --> 00:05:22.120
Then one more time!

00:05:22.120 --> 00:05:23.710
W-W-Wait!

00:05:23.710 --> 00:05:26.100
Do that again, and I'll get a bruise!

00:05:27.370 --> 00:05:31.030
But your face is funny when I do it...

00:05:31.030 --> 00:05:33.300
It's not funny!

00:05:33.300 --> 00:05:36.120
What are you two doing, so early?

00:05:36.120 --> 00:05:40.600
Al, do something.
At this rate, I'm not gonna last.

00:05:40.600 --> 00:05:44.090
Oh, you're having that much fun, huh?

00:05:44.090 --> 00:05:46.350
And at this hour...

00:05:47.690 --> 00:05:50.800
No, this is, um...

00:05:50.800 --> 00:05:52.710
You big fool!

00:05:55.370 --> 00:05:59.990
Extrapolating from your normal actions,

00:05:59.990 --> 00:06:02.350
anyone would've done the same thing.

00:06:02.350 --> 00:06:05.340
It was an emergency crime-prevention
measure.

00:06:05.340 --> 00:06:07.210
I did nothing wrong.

00:06:07.210 --> 00:06:08.420
Objection!

00:06:08.420 --> 00:06:11.350
Does it ever occur to you to just apologize?

00:06:12.550 --> 00:06:16.540
The girl's recovered, so what's the problem?

00:06:16.540 --> 00:06:19.760
Pain is a part of problem-solving.

00:06:19.760 --> 00:06:23.130
Pain that doesn't contribute to
solving the problem is useless.

00:06:24.100 --> 00:06:26.360
Kuro's funny!

00:06:28.690 --> 00:06:31.630
It's always the weak who cry.

00:06:31.630 --> 00:06:33.680
Yes, that's right...

00:06:34.900 --> 00:06:38.030
By the way, you said your name is Ennea.

00:06:38.690 --> 00:06:41.550
What were you doing out there last night?

00:06:42.220 --> 00:06:45.840
When I put you in the bath, there
were wounds all over your body.

00:06:45.840 --> 00:06:48.260
Does it have something to do with that?

00:06:48.260 --> 00:06:49.620
Hey, Al.

00:06:49.620 --> 00:06:51.670
You can't just ask...

00:06:51.670 --> 00:06:56.560
You don't have to say anything
you don't want to.

00:06:56.560 --> 00:07:00.770
But if we can help in any way,
we'll listen to what you have to say.

00:07:00.770 --> 00:07:03.660
I don't remember...

00:07:03.660 --> 00:07:05.310
Anything.

00:07:05.310 --> 00:07:08.870
Amnesia, then?

00:07:08.870 --> 00:07:10.650
Amnesia.

00:07:10.650 --> 00:07:13.570
I'm not a specialist, so I don't know the details.

00:07:13.570 --> 00:07:18.420
But if you need me to, I could make
introductions at a medical facility.

00:07:18.420 --> 00:07:19.750
Thanks.

00:07:19.750 --> 00:07:21.560
Then I'll take her, and...

00:07:22.920 --> 00:07:25.320
Hello? Hello?

00:07:25.320 --> 00:07:27.460
Hello?

00:07:29.460 --> 00:07:30.930
You shouldn't do that, Ennea.

00:07:30.930 --> 00:07:32.450
I'm having an important...

00:07:32.450 --> 00:07:34.130
I'm staying here.

00:07:35.100 --> 00:07:38.180
I'm going to live with Kuro!

00:07:39.100 --> 00:07:42.350
See? Told you she was trouble.

00:07:48.250 --> 00:07:50.020
Kuro, this is cute!

00:07:50.020 --> 00:07:52.240
This is cute, too!

00:07:52.240 --> 00:07:54.650
Make sure it's something I can afford, okay?

00:07:54.650 --> 00:07:58.590
You've gotten used to being
spun around by women.

00:07:58.590 --> 00:08:00.310
Don't want to hear it from you.

00:08:00.310 --> 00:08:02.910
So what are you going to do?

00:08:02.910 --> 00:08:05.500
We don't know where she's from or her age.

00:08:05.500 --> 00:08:08.010
We don't know her address. And when we
found her, she was badly wounded.

00:08:08.010 --> 00:08:10.300
And she has amnesia.

00:08:10.300 --> 00:08:12.840
All kinds of trouble...

00:08:14.630 --> 00:08:15.830
Hey, Kuro.

00:08:15.830 --> 00:08:16.940
What do you think of this?

00:08:16.940 --> 00:08:18.180
Is it cute?

00:08:21.160 --> 00:08:23.960
What you doing grabbing him?

00:08:25.030 --> 00:08:26.440
Jealousy?

00:08:26.440 --> 00:08:27.820
How ugly.

00:08:28.520 --> 00:08:33.690
I think that trouble just got worse...

00:08:33.690 --> 00:08:37.700
You think you're the closest one to Kuro,
so you're letting down your guard, huh?

00:08:37.700 --> 00:08:41.300
Wrong! Wrong! So totally wrong!

00:08:41.300 --> 00:08:43.530
Wh-Wh-Wh-Wha—

00:08:43.530 --> 00:08:49.150
But with a frail body like that,
maybe you never had a chance.

00:08:51.520 --> 00:08:52.920
Kuro...

00:08:52.920 --> 00:08:56.080
You big fool!

00:09:05.280 --> 00:09:07.440
You all right, Kuro?

00:09:07.440 --> 00:09:10.260
And now it gets even worse.

00:09:13.900 --> 00:09:18.400
Anyway, if you're going to live together,
you need to get along.

00:09:18.400 --> 00:09:19.420
Please.

00:09:19.420 --> 00:09:20.240
Okay!

00:09:20.240 --> 00:09:22.410
Hey, Kuro...

00:09:22.410 --> 00:09:25.710
Hey, what are you doing?!

00:09:27.160 --> 00:09:30.730
Kuro just said to get along,

00:09:30.730 --> 00:09:32.520
what are you mad about?

00:09:33.200 --> 00:09:35.180
Rookie...

00:09:35.180 --> 00:09:37.620
Don't get so close to my partner!

00:09:37.620 --> 00:09:40.590
But I love Kuro!

00:09:42.580 --> 00:09:45.460
Do you like this, Kuro?

00:09:46.280 --> 00:09:47.500
Soft, huh?

00:09:47.500 --> 00:09:49.730
Wh-Wh-What are you doing?

00:09:53.190 --> 00:09:55.510
Wh-Wh-Wh-What?!

00:09:55.510 --> 00:10:00.510
A terrifying sight, and in public, too.

00:10:00.510 --> 00:10:05.890
Not one but two young girls in your clutches.

00:10:05.890 --> 00:10:07.330
Kuro Daijuji,

00:10:07.330 --> 00:10:08.330
you are evil!

00:10:08.330 --> 00:10:10.090
And still more trouble...

00:10:10.090 --> 00:10:14.390
Now, on the great ranking board
of evil, I am above you.

00:10:14.390 --> 00:10:17.360
But in that particular field, you're above me.

00:10:17.360 --> 00:10:20.970
You're the Yokozuna of evil!
I lose. Forgive me.

00:10:20.970 --> 00:10:23.200
Don't say things people will misunderstand!

00:10:23.200 --> 00:10:24.800
You see, Elsa?

00:10:24.800 --> 00:10:28.590
He's a heavyweight-class pervert,
the most perverted of them all.

00:10:28.590 --> 00:10:31.820
You must not get close to him...

00:10:34.720 --> 00:10:37.350
Two or three are the same thing-robo!

00:10:38.250 --> 00:10:41.150
Thank you for taking care of my darling-robo.

00:10:41.940 --> 00:10:45.340
I'm Kuro's common-law wife, Elsa-robo.

00:10:45.340 --> 00:10:48.260
I'm not much good at anything,
but please be kind to me-robo.

00:10:48.260 --> 00:10:50.760
"Not much good at anything" is the
only part of that that's right.

00:10:50.760 --> 00:10:53.530
And don't make this more complicated!

00:10:53.530 --> 00:10:56.330
Why, you... Kuro Daijuji!

00:10:56.330 --> 00:11:00.940
You've been meeting Elsa behind my back?

00:11:03.380 --> 00:11:09.250
My only option is to bury you here,
before the marriage becomes official!

00:11:13.590 --> 00:11:16.690
You and I are destined to be torn apart-robo!

00:11:20.270 --> 00:11:22.410
I'm finally alone.

00:11:23.290 --> 00:11:26.700
How sad that my only remaining
place of peace is the bath.

00:11:27.360 --> 00:11:33.500
It's that time of year, when you want to
spend your whole life in the bath...

00:11:40.130 --> 00:11:41.370
Kuro!

00:11:41.370 --> 00:11:42.810
I'll wash your back!

00:11:42.810 --> 00:11:47.080
You're taking my last refuge from me?

00:11:48.720 --> 00:11:52.280
I thought I hadn't seen you...
So you were here!

00:11:52.280 --> 00:11:54.800
Don't try it, newbie!

00:11:54.800 --> 00:11:56.760
I'm going to wash Kuro's back!

00:11:56.760 --> 00:11:58.530
Then I get to wash everything else.

00:11:58.530 --> 00:12:00.810
You don't get to wash that, either!

00:12:00.810 --> 00:12:01.570
Oh, why not?

00:12:01.570 --> 00:12:02.680
It's not like you lose anything.

00:12:02.680 --> 00:12:03.460
You do.

00:12:03.460 --> 00:12:05.470
If you wash Kuro, he loses things!

00:12:05.470 --> 00:12:07.770
So don't do anything selfish!

00:12:12.710 --> 00:12:14.480
Kuro!

00:12:17.030 --> 00:12:18.760
Ennea...

00:12:19.610 --> 00:12:21.390
Are you okay?

00:12:21.390 --> 00:12:22.720
I'm sorry.

00:12:22.720 --> 00:12:25.840
I guess we went a bit too far.

00:12:26.360 --> 00:12:28.640
Al got mad and went to sleep?

00:12:28.640 --> 00:12:30.940
It'll be bad till she gets over it.

00:12:30.940 --> 00:12:34.060
Hey, you fight, don't you?

00:12:35.380 --> 00:12:38.270
Your body was covered with scars.

00:12:38.270 --> 00:12:39.870
Um, well...

00:12:40.680 --> 00:12:42.310
It's fine.

00:12:42.310 --> 00:12:44.070
I can tell.

00:12:45.510 --> 00:12:50.310
Fight... I guess I'm pretending to be a hero.

00:12:50.310 --> 00:12:52.350
Why?

00:12:52.350 --> 00:12:55.000
Why do you fight?

00:12:55.000 --> 00:12:58.370
Well, I have to do what I can,

00:12:58.370 --> 00:13:01.140
or I'd regret it, I guess.

00:13:01.140 --> 00:13:02.790
Regret it?

00:13:05.400 --> 00:13:07.100
Is that all?

00:13:07.100 --> 00:13:09.800
You must have really suffered.

00:13:09.800 --> 00:13:11.060
So...

00:13:11.060 --> 00:13:13.770
Why fight for something so vague?

00:13:13.770 --> 00:13:15.770
That's...

00:13:18.640 --> 00:13:21.180
I would regret it.

00:13:21.180 --> 00:13:23.980
What if it were all useless?

00:13:23.980 --> 00:13:27.600
What if you could know the future...

00:13:27.600 --> 00:13:30.250
And you knew that no matter
how hard you fought,

00:13:30.250 --> 00:13:31.660
you couldn't save anyone.

00:13:31.660 --> 00:13:35.000
You couldn't even save yourself.
Everything was useless.

00:13:35.000 --> 00:13:35.960
What would you do then?

00:13:36.920 --> 00:13:39.510
Could you still fight?

00:13:40.400 --> 00:13:43.240
Even if it were all useless, I don't know if

00:13:43.240 --> 00:13:45.970
I could stand back and do nothing...

00:13:45.970 --> 00:13:48.470
If I could just sit back and watch.

00:13:49.470 --> 00:13:51.770
I don't think I could.

00:13:51.770 --> 00:13:53.050
Kuro...

00:14:19.300 --> 00:14:21.370
They say that money gets lonely easily

00:14:21.370 --> 00:14:24.020
and likes to gather in one place.

00:14:24.020 --> 00:14:27.140
But then, why does it leave its friends?

00:14:27.890 --> 00:14:29.620
Kuro's used to being poor.

00:14:29.620 --> 00:14:32.050
When you have fun, you need to spend money!

00:14:32.050 --> 00:14:36.020
I've been poor so long, I can't.

00:14:37.280 --> 00:14:39.260
What are you doing?!

00:14:39.260 --> 00:14:41.870
You left it, so I thought you didn't want it.

00:14:41.870 --> 00:14:44.560
I save my favorite part for last.

00:14:44.560 --> 00:14:45.420
And you...

00:14:45.420 --> 00:14:46.660
Unforgivable!

00:14:47.730 --> 00:14:49.520
Damn you!

00:14:49.520 --> 00:14:52.090
When you take revenge,
you need to pay back double.

00:14:56.970 --> 00:14:59.230
Hey, is that what I get for taking a strawberry?

00:14:59.230 --> 00:15:01.480
<i>Kuro, I'm glad I met you.</i>

00:15:03.050 --> 00:15:04.550
What is it, Ennea?

00:15:05.280 --> 00:15:06.880
Kuro!

00:15:06.880 --> 00:15:08.020
They're...

00:15:13.740 --> 00:15:16.080
Are you okay, Ennea?

00:15:16.080 --> 00:15:17.030
Kuro.

00:15:17.790 --> 00:15:19.180
How awful...

00:15:20.180 --> 00:15:22.570
We were searching for the Tyrant,

00:15:22.570 --> 00:15:25.670
and we find Kuro and Al Azif, too!

00:15:25.670 --> 00:15:28.790
We're super-lucky, Caligula!

00:15:28.790 --> 00:15:30.830
You're too hyper, Claudius.

00:15:30.830 --> 00:15:32.140
Don't let down your guard.

00:15:32.140 --> 00:15:34.120
Are you with the Black Lodge?

00:15:34.120 --> 00:15:35.450
That's right.

00:15:35.450 --> 00:15:38.420
I'm Claudius of Anticross.

00:15:38.420 --> 00:15:41.620
Caligula of Anticross.

00:15:41.620 --> 00:15:47.570
Hand over the girl, and I'll
give you a painless death.

00:15:47.570 --> 00:15:48.500
What?

00:15:48.500 --> 00:15:50.730
They're after Ennea!

00:15:50.730 --> 00:15:52.700
Get her to a nearby evacuation shelter.

00:15:52.700 --> 00:15:54.300
I'll draw their attention.

00:15:54.300 --> 00:15:55.170
Kuro!

00:15:55.170 --> 00:15:57.230
<i>Scimitar of Barzai!</i>

00:16:17.890 --> 00:16:18.620
Kuro!

00:16:21.960 --> 00:16:23.880
Don't screw with me, bastard.

00:16:23.880 --> 00:16:25.530
I'll make your death painful!

00:16:30.130 --> 00:16:31.680
Damn it...

00:16:31.680 --> 00:16:32.990
Loser.

00:16:32.990 --> 00:16:35.250
They were having a hard time with this guy?

00:16:35.250 --> 00:16:37.070
Too damned weak.

00:16:38.040 --> 00:16:40.940
You're annoying, so die here.

00:16:50.290 --> 00:16:51.560
The Tyrant.

00:17:00.630 --> 00:17:03.000
That's... A grimoire!

00:17:09.680 --> 00:17:11.880
What?

00:17:16.850 --> 00:17:18.510
The Tyrant's weapons?

00:17:18.510 --> 00:17:19.870
Why?

00:17:30.560 --> 00:17:32.530
<i>Cthaat Aquadingen!</i>

00:17:44.540 --> 00:17:46.320
Kraken.

00:17:46.320 --> 00:17:47.880
Destroy, destroy!

00:17:47.880 --> 00:17:50.510
Destroy!

00:17:59.160 --> 00:18:02.460
This is what happens when he gets mad...

00:18:02.460 --> 00:18:05.100
Lord Byakhee!

00:18:12.840 --> 00:18:15.170
Two Deus Machina!

00:18:15.170 --> 00:18:17.550
We'll go ahead, too, Al!

00:18:17.550 --> 00:18:18.710
Demonbane!

00:18:28.920 --> 00:18:30.050
What are you going to do?

00:18:30.050 --> 00:18:31.790
We're at a huge disadvantage!

00:18:31.790 --> 00:18:35.430
But I can't just ran away!

00:18:35.430 --> 00:18:36.440
What's the situation?

00:18:36.440 --> 00:18:40.430
Demonbane is fighting two
enemy Deus Machina!

00:18:40.430 --> 00:18:41.130
Two?

00:18:41.940 --> 00:18:45.600
The battle is expanding from the
bay area to the main city!

00:18:52.590 --> 00:18:54.480
Kuro! Are you okay?

00:18:54.480 --> 00:18:57.550
You were just sitting there, so I ran over you.

00:18:57.550 --> 00:19:01.600
Destroy! Destroy! Destroy!

00:19:01.600 --> 00:19:05.470
It'll take more than that!

00:19:07.320 --> 00:19:09.470
Hey, Kuro, that's...

00:19:10.290 --> 00:19:11.820
Ennea!

00:19:11.820 --> 00:19:13.700
It's dangerous. Run!

00:19:18.890 --> 00:19:20.680
Don't!

00:19:22.040 --> 00:19:24.410
Ennea, hurry!

00:19:24.410 --> 00:19:26.180
Run!

00:19:26.180 --> 00:19:28.150
You're wide-open.

00:19:29.330 --> 00:19:31.150
Die!

00:19:42.010 --> 00:19:42.890
Ennea!

00:19:45.830 --> 00:19:47.570
<i>What if it were all useless?</i>

00:19:48.110 --> 00:19:50.160
<i>Could you still fight?</i>

00:19:52.570 --> 00:19:55.960
Ennea!

00:20:00.390 --> 00:20:02.310
Kuro!

00:20:02.310 --> 00:20:04.520
What's wrong, Kuro?

00:20:06.680 --> 00:20:10.090
You have to let me enjoy myself more.

00:20:21.770 --> 00:20:23.150
What's wrong, Kuro?!

00:20:23.150 --> 00:20:24.300
Counterattack!

00:20:27.940 --> 00:20:28.970
Kuro?

00:20:40.410 --> 00:20:42.860
Ultra-high density magic signal detected.

00:20:42.860 --> 00:20:44.650
Something is about to materialize.

00:20:44.650 --> 00:20:47.510
This ethereal composition...

00:20:47.510 --> 00:20:49.360
It's Cthugha and Ithaqua!

00:20:49.360 --> 00:20:50.610
It can't be...

00:20:50.610 --> 00:20:51.800
Demonbane...

00:20:51.800 --> 00:20:53.770
Spiritual pressure has topped 30,000.

00:20:53.770 --> 00:20:55.300
It's surpassing the limits!

00:20:57.110 --> 00:20:58.750
Stop, Mr. Daijuji.

00:20:58.750 --> 00:21:00.240
It's dangerous!

00:21:12.520 --> 00:21:16.650
He summoned the power
of two Great Old Ones?

00:21:16.650 --> 00:21:19.620
Is your damned brain fried?!

00:21:19.620 --> 00:21:21.800
Stop it, Kuro!

00:21:21.800 --> 00:21:22.960
It's impossible!

00:21:22.960 --> 00:21:24.680
Come back to sanity!

00:21:24.680 --> 00:21:27.760
I... I... I...

00:21:27.760 --> 00:21:28.760
Do it.

00:21:28.760 --> 00:21:30.560
Release your rage.

00:21:40.610 --> 00:21:42.110
Cthugha?

00:21:45.680 --> 00:21:47.180
And Ithaqua, too?

00:21:51.620 --> 00:21:54.330
The spiritual pressure values
returned to normal?

00:21:55.390 --> 00:21:57.290
They're controllable!

00:21:57.290 --> 00:21:58.820
What the hell?

00:21:58.820 --> 00:22:01.030
Why does Demonbane have the Tyrant's guns?

00:22:32.110 --> 00:22:33.730
Kuro...

00:22:42.080 --> 00:22:43.770
Ennea...

00:24:35.320 --> 00:24:37.390
Heaven burns and falls.

00:24:37.390 --> 00:24:38.930
The land sinks into mud.

00:24:38.930 --> 00:24:40.430
Time freezes,

00:24:40.430 --> 00:24:42.030
and death, itself, dies.

00:24:42.030 --> 00:24:44.290
Next time: Big "C."

00:24:44.290 --> 00:24:47.190
Now, let us cheer madly,

00:24:47.190 --> 00:24:49.980
and play our roles in this brilliant tragedy.
